# text = The noble Earl has mentioned the system established first at Shanghai , and since extended to other ports , by which what is called foreign inspectorships have been established , and under which , as now finally arranged , foreign gentlemen , officers of the Chinese Government , and independent of foreign Governments , are to superintend the collection of duties .
