# text_id = 1612
# text = If the Ministry of Art and Architecture were placed on its proper footing of dignity and emolument , good men could be got for the superintendence of that department as well as for others , because young men who were ambitious would read up for it as they did now for the Treasury , the Colonies , or the Foreign Department .
