# text = MR. GLADSTONE said , he regretted I that the right hon . Gentleman ( Mr. Disraeli ) had not explained himself more fully than he had done , because his few words in the nature of assertion , and not of argument , did not show the occasion for the Amendment , or that it was in itself exceptionable .
