# text_id = 1629
# text = The effect of the present system was to increase to the utmost the production of every description of sugar , and the effect of lowering the scale would be to bring into the market such coarse sugar as perhaps the African , who was incapable of the delicate operations of refining , might be able to produce from the cane .
