# text_id = 1651
# text = The hon . Member for Horsham ( Mr. S. Fitzgerald ) thought it strange that hon . Gentlemen below the gangway should object to the paying of attachés , or to the raising of their salaries , because , he said , that by so doing they were handing over the offices to the exclusive possession of aristocratic persons .
