# text_id = 1672
# text = In reference to what had been said by the noble Earl of what might happen next year , he thought it was impossible to say anything on this point ; but he believed that many time - honoured institutions — quite as time - honoured as the Protestant Establishment in Ireland — would perhaps by that time be in considerable danger .
