# text_id = 1674
# text = The balance of £ 1,500,000 for which he was thus obliged to provide , added to the million and a quarter of which he had already spoken , made £ 2,750,000 , which approached as closely as possible to the three millions he had been obliged to borrow to put the finances right at the end of the year .
