# text_id = 1676
# text = My Lords , upon the highest authorities — upon such authorities as Blackstone — I assert that the other House of Parliament has no authority , and , practically speaking , ought not to have the power , to originate any such clause , as that persons who have once been summoned to this House should no longer retain their seats .
