# text = He was struck very forcibly with the spirit of discontent and dissatisfaction which was excited at the time when it was proposed to amalgamate a regiment of Tipperary Militia with the Royal Artillery , and if that feeling could exist among men domiciled at home , what must be the feeling of men several thousand miles away from home ?
