# text_id = 1687
# text = Mr. Arbuthnot , the auditor of the Civil List , was of opinion that the effect of the competition had been to exclude objectionable men ; but that , in the case of the supplementary clerks of the Treasury , it had introduced a class of men above their work , and thus gave rise to discontent and inconvenience .
