# text_id = 1714
# text = Even in two years of our last war with America , from 1812 to 1814 , no less than 2,500 of our ships , with cargoes valued at upwards of twenty millions , were taken by the Americans , although at that time we had , he believed , little less than 1,000 ships - of - war on the seas .
