# text_id = 1727
# text = The right hon . Baronet ( Sir Charles Wood ) asked him ( Captain Jervis ) last year whether it was usual in other countries that officers whose services were not required should be kept on full pay , and then the right hon . Gentleman said they ought to be placed on half - pay or got rid of altogether .
