# text_id = 1730
# text = THE MARQUESS OF HARTINGTON said , in reply , that the 2nd Battalion of the 20th Regiment had received orders to proceed from Japan to Hong Kong , to relieve the regiment at present stationed there ; but it would not be necessary that they should occupy the quarters vacated by the 11th Regiment , which had proceeded to the Cape .
