# text = With the scores of great shipbuilding firms scattered round the coast who would be able and willing to undertake the contracts , he thought it would have been more prudent had the Government postponed the commencement of the novel and expensive system of iron shipbuilding at Chatham at least until they had some experience of the Warrior and Black Prince .
