# text_id = 1749
# text = My answer , Sir , to the Question of the hon . Member for Durham is this — it is the intention of the Government , in moving the Navy Estimates , to propose the building of two iron gunboats ; and the specifications are now being prepared , so that we may receive the tenders as early as possible .
