# text_id = 1752
# text = If the country had spent more money than ought to have been spent upon the attainment of objects which were professedly desirable or necessary , if the Government were wasting any of that money , whether spending seventy millions , or sixty , or fifty , or only ten millions , they were equally to be blamed for that waste .
