# text = Before my late lamented friend Mr. Cobden had made his proposal that any person should vote only for one Member , in my Bill of 1859 , which hon . Gentlemen opposite have to a large extent adopted , I proposed that these large borouahs — some of the very largest , at all events — should have six Members each .
