# text_id = 1769
# text = To repeal the enactment because it was to a certain extent inoperative was not the proper mode of proceeding , for that would countenance every description of gambling that the ingenuity of man could devise , and they would have no right afterwards to break into houses on suspicion that gambling was carried on , or to punish the detected parties .
