# text_id = 1770
# text = Already the Legislature had , by the passing of the Houseless Poor Act and the Poor Law Amendment Act of the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Oxford University , made great strides on the road to centralization , between which system and local self - government there existed not only diversities of feature , but an antagonism of principle .
