# text = Those who have attended to the debates upon the second reading of this measure must be aware that they turned almost exclusively upon the question of the franchise ; they turned mainly upon the question of the borough franchise — whether or no it should be lowered from £ 10 to £ 6 , or any amount lower than £ 10 .
