# text = It must be recollected that some of the hon . Gentlemen who indulged in those lamentations for the future prosperity of the Protestant Church in Ireland , when they came to another part of their argument , stated that , in their opinion , seven - eighths of the soil of Ireland were in the hands of Protestant proprietors .
