# text_id = 1785
# text = COLONEL NORTH , referring to a Committee appointed on his Motion many years ago said , there was hardly a distinguished officer of the Royal Artillery and Engineers examined who did not express the opinion that the ages for admission into the Engineer and Artillery corps should be lowered , and that the educational test should be lowered also .
