# text_id = 1787
# text = In conclusion , then , if the Government rejected a Bill which had for its object the security of the country from cattle disease in future , and passed only a Bill for restricting the movement of cattle within the country , they would incur a heavy responsibility , and be guilty of a gross injustice to the agricultural interest .
