# text_id = 1790
# text = By such a proceeding an extraordinary and dangerous power would be placed in his hands , and that House would reverse the award of the arbitrators — only appointed last year , with the mutual consent of the Government and the Company — which ruled that the Directors were bound to retain the unclaimed dividends for the proprietors and Company .
