# text_id = 1791
# text = He could not close his observations without expressing the greatest admiration for the conduct of the Military Medical Department , and especially for the conduct of Dr. Saunders , surgeon of the 9th Regiment , who , in the absence of his senior ( Dr. Dick ) , took the whole responsibility on his own shoulders and saved many valuable lives .
