# text_id = 1792
# text = MR. MORLEY said , he hoped that the hon . and learned Attorney General would lose no time in placing the Bill in the hands of hon . Members , so that , consistently with a due consideration of the measure , as little delay as possible should take place in the passing of the Bill through that House .
