# text_id = 1795
# text = He really thought that when distinguished foreigners came to this country , who had rendered services to this country , they ought not to be rewarded by being sent to an hotel ; and when they were to have some token of recognition through the Foreign Minister , they ought not to be rewarded by the present of an English rifle .
