# text_id = 1796
# text = The noble Earl appears to think that the Royal Sovereign is the only ship ever intended for Captain Coles , whereas , in fact , the Prince Alfred , a remarkably fine vessel , was expressly designed for the trial of his invention , although that vessel was not completed until a year after the time allowed for its building .
