# text = THE CHANCELLOR OF THE EXCHEQUER said , in reply , that if the hon . Gentleman would look to the 18th clause of the 3rd section of the Act , and take the trouble to compare it with former Acts , he would find that no exemption now granted by those Acts was taken away by the system of Excise Licenses .
