# text = The hon . Baronet will find that by the 6th Article all that Her Majesty engages herself to recommend her Parliament to do is to impose a duty upon wine containing a certain proportion of proof spirit not exceeding 1s . per gallon , and on wine containing 36 degrees of spirit a duty not exceeding 1s . 6d. per gallon .
