# text_id = 1808
# text = Consisting , as it did , of men of all sides and of all views , it was not an unimportant body , and the gentlemen of whom it was composed publicly declared that , in their opinion , if the recommendations contained in the Report of the Commissioners were carried out they would be destructive of the present system .
