# text_id = 1813
# text = Hon . Members who laughed might think that an evidence that the voters liked corruption , but that they were actuated by a desire to prevent corruption would be proved by a petition which was to be presented to the House , signed by 1,000 out of 1,500 electors of the borough , declaring that the Ballot was the only means of putting an end to the corruption which prevailed .
