# text_id = 1814
# text = With regard to the application of these collections at the Museum to purposes of general instruction , I am much inclined to agree with my hon . Friend who made the Motion , that if it could be shown that arrangements could be made , without expense to the public , by which those collections might be made the foundation for instructive lectures , that would be a most desirable object .
