# text_id = 1816
# text = The representations that have been made to me are of a general and partially indefinite character , while , at the same time , they are representations which , on account of the quarters from which they proceed , are entitled to the greatest weight and importance , and are entitled to the most anxious , careful , and , I may add , the immediate consideration of the Government .
