# text_id = 1820
# text = I wish your Lordships to understand that I am speaking now solely of the declarations required by the University , and not of clerical subscription , which is a matter totally apart from the question whether it is necessary that young men who have fairly won and deserved the honours due to their attainments should be required to subscribe their assent to the Thirty - nine Articles or to the Liturgy .
