# text_id = 1821
# text = When calculations of this sort — calculations not merely of grandeur , but approaching to sublimity — were published by the Madras Government , it was not to be wondered at that the cupidity of certain gentlemen in London was excited , and that they should yearn to embark in enterprises like those to which he had referred , which seemed to offer such stupendous returns from a comparatively insignificant outlay .
