# text_id = 1825
# text = Under the advice of the noble Lord the Member for Chester ( Earl Grosvenor ) , and with the assistance of the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Kilmarnock ( Mr. Bouverie ) , the House were called upon , at the end of May , for an expression of opinion in favour of amalgamating the measures — a proceeding which in March the Government declared to he impracticable .
