# text_id = 1826
# text = On the contrary , it seemed to him that its direct tendency would be to excite in France a state of irritation against this country , to postpone the period at which real freedom of trade might be established between the two nations , and to bring it to pass that for at least a year and a half , the state of things should be full of political danger .
