# text = But I would not venture to ask the House for the appointment of a Committee of Inquiry if I thought that the sole cause of the depression was the over - supply of ships , because I fear I should thus be setting a precedent that would justify other interests , when they were in a depressed state , to come before this House with a demand for inquiry .
