# text_id = 1830
# text = As the Member selected by The Times through whom to offer an insult to the House of Commons more gross than any yet offered by Mr. Bright , whom you rebuked , I feel called upon to repudiate , as publicly as it was made , a description of the character and sentiments of the House which every Member of it will repel as indignantly as I do myself .
