# text_id = 1831
# text = He had not the slightest personal interest in the matter , and in calling attention to it he was actuated only by a sense of duty , and a desire to see justice done to an honourable body of men who had fought gallantly and success - fully for their Queen in India , in the suppression of the unhappy mutiny and rebellion which broke out there a few years ago .
