# text_id = 1832
# text = MR. BAINES , in rising to move for leave to bring in a Bill to extend the Parliamentary franchise in the boroughs of England and Wales said , that the object of the Bill was single and simple — namely , to extend the franchise which was fixed by the Reform Act of 1832 at £ 10 to £ 6 , according to the Bill proposed by the Government last year .
