# text_id = 1833
# text = But if the matter is thrown loose again I am at liberty to speculate that the business will be double , and that the appeals will be double in number ; and I say that if that is all the appellate tribunal will have to do you do not want a Chief Judge with £ 5,000 a year , and all the costs of a new Judge to do it .
