# text_id = 1837
# text = We heard a noble and gallant Earl on the opposite side ( the Earl of Cardigan ) , yielding to that feeling of discipline which distinguishes the glorious profession to which he belongs , declare that though this Bill was Radical and dangerous , and fraught with the most evil consequences , he was determined to vote for it , and trust to good luck to escape those consequences .
