# text_id = 1841
# text = There was one great advantage connected with those places , which his hon . Friend had thrown in parenthetically , but which he thought worthy of more prominent mention , and that was that peace and order were to be found there , security and quiet possession were enjoyed by the owners of property — advantages not to be found in every part of Ireland at the present moment .
