# text_id = 1842
# text = I will only add this — if I may be allowed to say so , without meaning anything in the least degree discourteous to the House — that when the House of Commons takes into its own hands administrative details , and takes them out of the hands of the executive Government , the probability is that such a course will be attended with increased expense and diminished efficiency .
