# text_id = 1844
# text = President Lincoln was a man who , though not conspicuous before his election , had since displayed a character of so much integrity , so much sincerity and straightforwardness , and at the same time of so much kindness , that if any one could have been able to alleviate the pain and animosities which prevailed during the period of civil war , I believe that President Lincoln was that person .
