# text = Now , there may be twenty , thirty , or forty gentlemen — I do not believe there are so many — standing in the category thus described by my hon . Friend — that is to say , of laymen who are , nevertheless , teachers of future clergymen ; and I do not prejudge at this moment the question of what course you ought to adopt with them .
