# text = It was a case in which special tact was necessary in conducting negotiations with Brazil , because this charge about the murder of the seamen has never been substantiated — there never has been a tittle of evidence to prove it , and the grounds on which Mr. Christie made the charge rested on the statement of a gentleman whom he himself states to have been labouring under mental delusion .
