# text_id = 1859
# text = I estimate the loss of capitalists , arising from loss of interest , depreciation of fixed capital , non-payment of rents of cottages ( not including loss of profits , though that is a loss of income ) , to be at the rate of £ 5,000,000 for the year up to next Midsummer upon mills , manufactures , and all establishments forming subsidiary branches of the cotton manufacture .
