# text_id = 1867
# text = He should not , however , take the sense of the House on the point , but he wished to move an Amendment — Every Inquiry under this Act shall be conducted in public , and due Notice shall be given of the Time and Place of holding the same , but with Power to the Person or Persons conducting the same to adjourn any Meeting as Occasion may require .
