# text_id = 1868
# text = A Select Committee might go into those questions if necessary , but as it seemed that even so moderate an addition as the rating of mines could not be made to the Bill lie did not see what a Select Committee could do with it , the narrow limited subject with which the Bill dealt having already been pronounced upon by more than one Select Committee of that House .
