# text_id = 1869
# text = Per haps , Sir , I owe some explanation to the House for having chosen a Supply night for the discussion of this question ; but I trust the House will allow that I have not been infringing upon a Government night unnecessarily , because the public business has been proceeded with so rapidly that I think they may well spare a night for the discussion of so important a question .
