# text_id = 1870
# text = Well , for twenty - four years — from 1841 to 1865 — he was a Member of this House , yet during the whole of that period he felt himself restrained from accepting any official invitation either from Viscount Eversley , when he held the office of Speaker , or from the right hon . Gentleman below me ( Mr. Denison ) while he has occupied the Chair .
