# text_id = 1872
# text = The best way of collecting the opinions of the Province on a question of this kind is , I should say , through the acts of its Legislature — through the proceedings of its representative body ; and the hon . Gentleman is the last person from whom I should have ex- pected an objection to our ascertaining the opinion of the Province from the sentiments of its representative body .
