# text_id = 1878
# text = When he first heard of the intended measure he naturally , as a citizen and a man moving in society , was anxious to learn some valid cause for such a Bill being brought in by the Government ; but he had heard nothing except an expression of opinion from the noble Lord who had just sat down , that some redress should be given for grievances which he saw .
