# text_id = 1882
# text = At the same time he believed that the Bill did not work at all well , or even cheaper than the old courts , and the money it had cost was entirely thrown away ; for he had never heard any one , either in the profession or out of it , state that it had been productive of more benefit than could have been produced by reforming the Ecclesiastical Courts .
