# text_id = 1883
# text = MR. ALDERMAN LUSK said , the Budget was universally accepted out - of - doors as an excellent one , and the right hon . Gentleman was much complimented on his ability in framing it ; and he was therefore astonished that , in that House , one Member after another rose and found something wrong in the Budget , starting grievances which had never before been heard of .
