# text_id = 1884
# text = But , in the first place , I must assure the most rev. Primate ( the Archbishop of Dublin ) , who spoke earlier in the debate , that it is far from my intention to use any harsh terms in reference to the past history of the Irish Church , and that nothing shall fall from my lips other than what is respectful towards the clergy of that Church .
