# text_id = 1889
# text = MR. HARVEY LEWIS said , he wished to ask the First Commissioner of Works , Whether his attention has been called to the practice of permitting Sheep to be washed in the Serpentine in the same spot where bathing is allowed ; and , whether it is true that last year an express promise was given that the pollution of the water from such improper practice should not be again sanctioned ?
