# text = And now I think I have done something to refute the charge brought against us if I show that four out of the five gentlemen cited by my hon . Friend have given answers which , in a more or less degree , are favourable to the system of competition , while the fifth , whose evidence is partially unfavourable , is quoted at full length in the Report .
