# text_id = 1895
# text = Year by year she has expanded ; year by year she is building more churches , opening more schools , carrying her spiritual ministrations lower and lower down among the masses of ignorance and poverty and crime in our own population , spreading far and wide her missionary work and her teaching into distant lands — in one word , reigning in the hearts and minds of the people .
