# text = He had regard simply to the present position of the country , to our increasing expenditure , and to the expediency of making , if it could be done , arrangements for the remission of the war duties on tea and sugar and the reduction of the income tax to a level more in accordance with the feelings and wishes of the community than that at which it at present stood .
