# text_id = 1897
# text = In this respect I think your Lordships will see reason to commend the conduct of the Lord Lieutenant , who , while desirous to put down the insurrection , and restore the country to peace and tranquillity , was at the same time anxious to perform that service to the Queen and country by the ordinary means of the law , and without any suspension of the Constitution in Ireland .
