# text_id = 1899
# text = During the last eight years there had been no less than four Reform Bills , and all the four admitted the principle of extending the franchise to occupiers in counties to be sound and just ; while three of those measures , including that of the right hon . Gentleman opposite ( Mr. Disraeli ) , lowered the franchise to the very amount for which he had always contended .
