# text_id = 1905
# text = That is not , I repeat , an unimportant matter , because I , for one , think , that great as is the power of this country , we are not in a position to afford that small States , while acknowledging their inferiority to us in point of strength , should be given the opportunity of protesting before the world against the course which we have pursued towards them .
