# text_id = 1907
# text = The hon . Baronet was right in saying that crime had ceased in the county , but it ceased by reason of the vigorous enforcement of the law and by the application of the powers of this Act — an Act which every gentleman of every persuasion who had any property in the county wished to see enforced , if they desired to retain their property or their lives .
