# text = MR. SIDNEY HERBERT , in reply , said , with regard to the question which had been last addressed to him , he could state that the subject had been under the consideration of the Government for a considerable time — it was a matter which had been discussed between the Officers and the Government with — he would state frankly — very little prospect of a satisfactory result .
