# text_id = 1909
# text = They complain , for instance , in one village that they had no church in which they could listen to a sermon in their own language , and to which they could send their children to be taught according to their own ideas ; and , under these circumstances , it was not strange that they should desire to send a petition to the Sovereign to ask for redress .
