# text_id = 1912
# text = In the payment of his taxes every one ought to be able to rejoice as the means by which he is best able to secure his personal safety from external foes or domestic dangers , and protection for his property and for his industry — by which , in short , he obtains the immense benefits which result from the good government , which is a main feature of advanced civilization .
