# text_id = 1913
# text = Archbishop Sheldon declared that the subscription imposed on the clergy was expressly intended to exclude from the Church the Puritan ( now called the Evangelical ) section of her ministers ; and he even went the length of saying , that if he had known that so many of that class would , nevertheless , have remained within her pale , he would have endeavoured to make the door still narrower .
