# text_id = 1914
# text = His chief business would be to treat of matters of commerce , to protect his own countrymen residing in the country , and to obtain reparation for them if any of them chanced to sustain injury ; and it is a serious question to consider whether this could best be done by a Minister residing at Pekin , or at one of the outports , and going to Pekin occasionally .
