# text_id = 1915
# text = The truth is that the abolition of the slave trade , although it may be , and , in some instances , has been brought about , as in the case of Brazil , by the exercise of force , cannot be wholly extinguished except by the progress of opinion , not only in the minds of different Governments , but in the minds of the different nations which they rule .
