# text_id = 1920
# text = My Lords , I do Hot desire , having regard to my own character and position , that the noble and learned Lord should have used any different tone or exhibited any different manner from those he has displayed in bringing forward this subject ; for it must be evident to all who have heard him , that if he pities the clerks much , he hates the Lord Chancellor more .
