# text = One of them relates to the Bills as to which my right hon . Friend the Member for Ashton ( Mr. Milner Gibson ) has inquired whether , in case they are contested , the Government would go forward with them or not , and on that matter the answer of the right hon . Gentleman the First Minister of the Crown is a perfectly just and fair answer .
