# text_id = 1929
# text = Perhaps , however , there could hardly be a more striking illustration of the change which was now taking place than was to be found in the fact , that there was good reason to believe that the Royal Sovereign , reduced in size and carrying five guns , was a more valuable and effective ship than before she was cut down , and when she carried 130 guns .
