# text_id = 1933
# text = I have again and again entreated your Lordships to rise to an occasion that demands the exercise of legislative power and wisdom , to awaken to a sense of the great duty upon you , and accomplish the great object of peace and religious equality and religious justice by distributing the surplus in a manner equal to the demands and equal to the necessities of the several religious bodies in Ireland .
