# text_id = 1937
# text = It was really a matter of serious importance that it should not be thought in the country that the House was strangling Reform by indirect means , that the measure was not met fairly and frankly by direct negatives , but that advantage was taken of Motions and Amendments brought forward by persons professing to be favourable to Reform to defeat Reform with the aid of persons altogether opposed to it .
