# text_id = 1940
# text = He ought to mention that one part of the Bill which he proposed sought to adopt the suggestion which was made to him some years ago by the right hon . Gentleman below him ( Sir James Graham ) , with regard to occupiers , to the effect that a portion of their holding , say to the extent of £ 5 or £ 6 , should consist of a House .
