# text_id = 1941
# text = I am willing to extend the most perfect respect to the sincere opinions and convictions of the Roman Catholic Church , though I do not agree with them ; but I may , at the same time , be excused for preferring the doctrines maintained by my own Church , and for feeling alarm and jealousy at any policy which would be injurious to the spread of those doctrines .
