# text_id = 1942
# text = It was obvious that , after the course taken by the Government of Lord Derby last year , only Government could settle the question , and he regretted that his hon . Friend had been permitted to bring forward once more a proposal which , though it had been carried year after year in that House by large majorities , left the question no nearer a settlement than before .
