# text_id = 1945
# text = Had the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Stroud ( Mr. Horsman ) been present at the commencement of his observations , he would have known that he absolutely withdrew the abstract proposals contained in his Amendment , and that he invited the House to retain the power of dealing with the financial proposals of the Government in the same manner in which they were treated last year .
