# text_id = 1947
# text = After the statement of his hon . Friend he would not trespass on the time of the House by reciting the gallant actions of these men , neither would he now refer to their advancing years and infirmities ; but he would ask the House to recognize , by adopting this Motion , the energy , activity , and fidelity with which they had served their country during the long war .
