# text_id = 1950
# text = Viewing the gravity of this crisis , and viewing the consequences which would have resulted had the measure been again relegated to the public opinion of this country and of Ireland , I , for one , am gratified at the result which has transpired , and I tender to my noble and learned Friend my thanks for the judicious manner in which he has carried on these negotiations .
