# text_id = 1960
# text = When , therefore , they remembered , as he had stated , that the average of general mortality was twenty - two in 1,000 , and that these model lodging - houses were built in some of the worst localities of London , where the death - rate was sometimes as high as thirty - five , they would acknowledge how vast were the benefits to be derived from good dwellings .
