# text_id = 1962
# text = These extracts show most clearly that the reason why the tenant did not expend his labour and capital on the land — in other words , in improving his dwelling and his out - offices , and in developing the capabilities of the soil — was , that he did not know when he might be removed , or his rent raised to the full value of his own improvements .
