# text_id = 1965
# text = Sir , I should very much regret if the Question of my hon . Friend inferred any reflection upon Lord Lyons for not being at his post ; but I rejoice at this opportunity of bearing my testimony to the singular zeal , tact , discretion , and ability with which Lord Lyons has carried on the business of this country at Washington during a most critical and important period .
