# text_id = 1966
# text = I honestly desire that you will now try and make the people of Ireland — those whom we can still call our own — prosperous , independent , and happy , the friends of peace , law , and order ; and , Sir , the statesman who will effect this , by wise and liberal legislation , will prove himself the greatest benefactor that country has ever possessed .
