# text_id = 1970
# text = It is to be regretted , although I do not think it is matter of blame to anyone , that there was no discussion on the subject of this Bill when it was read a second time ; because it involves consideration of a nature that can hardly be discussed in Committee , unless we consider broader questions than are raised by any clause on the Motion for postponing the Preamble .
