# text_id = 1973
# text = But in the year 1857 a Petition was presented against his return , charging him and his Agents with nearly every crime which could invalidate an election That Petition , he should confess , had caused him considerable uneasiness , and he had gone about anxiously inquiring whether his agents might not , in disobedience of his instructions , have done something which would disqualify him from sitting in Parliament .
