# text = He would not shelter himself under the suggestion of the hon . Member for Pontefract ( Mr. Childers ) , but would explain , in answer to the hon . Baronet , the Member for Evesham ( Sir Henry Willoughby ) , that the extra allowances given to the troops in Australia were paid direct to the troops , and , therefore , did not come into our accounts .
