# text_id = 1980
# text = All that we had here as general measures was this — that all charges which were likely to be made , independently of the actual execution of deeds , were all , under different Acts of Parliament , brought into one office where , at an expense of only 1s. , these charges could easily be ascertained , and it might be easily seen whether the title was clear .
