# text = Then , of course , the question would have been asked whether the law of the United States was substantially different from our own , or whether our law was inferior in efficiency to the law of the United States ; for if it was not , and if the United States Government thought their own law adequate , Parliament would scarcely have entertained the idea of altering it .
