# text_id = 1982
# text = No man can deny that this Volunteer movement has been a most magnificent , national movement , and that it has been carried on with a spirit of patriotism which is most honourable to the country ; and I believe that if occasion should require it — if an emergency should arise — we should see that force amount to double or treble the number who now surround their standards .
