# text_id = 1983
# text = It appears to me to have been singularly disingenuous of this society to have excluded from the collection of letters which they have circulated that letter of Mr. Hardy , the head of the department , a gentleman of the highest character , in which he stated that no document could be abstracted from the office , nor even altered , so effectual were the precautions taken in the office .
