# text_id = 1984
# text = THE EARL OF DONOUGHMORE , in rising to call the Attention of the House to the Proposal for forming a Brigade of Royal Artillery out of the Tipperary Regiment of Militia Artillery , said — My Lords , I have often had occasion to address this House since I had the honour of a seat in it , and I have always experienced from your Lordships the greatest kindness and forbearance .
