# text_id = 1986
# text = If I had been stating anything that was in the slightest degree a matter of feeling or reproach to the hon . Member , I would willingly have given way ; but I was pointing out how entirely erroneous his statement was , and what are the opportunities , according to the present form of debate , that are enjoyed by the House of considering the financial measures of the Government .
