# text_id = 1987
# text = It must , not however , be understood from this , that all the witnesses at last " settled down " upon one statement ; but only that one statement was at last " settled down " upon by each witness , the final statement of each being , however , in important particulars both inconsistent with the final statements of others , and full of the wildest absurdities .
