# text_id = 1989
# text = There were people , he knew , who , now that this question had become a matter of general conversation and discussion throughout Europe , wished that the statement made last July should he repeated ; there might be reasons why the Government should decline to make any such statement ; but , at any rate , the question had assumed a much more serious shape since last July .
