# text_id = 1993
# text = The front towards Parliament Street will be seen , the front towards the Park will also be seen ; but the side towards Downing Street will not be much seen , while the other side will not be seen at all ; and , therefore , it would be a waste of public money to throw away a great deal in constructing a highly ornamented building for a Foreign Office .
