# text_id = 1994
# text = Suppose when they are going home to - night one of them were attacked by any body , or ill - treated in any manner , and had his property plundered ; and suppose another person observed what took place , and he happened to be of certain religious opinions , how would that hon . Gentleman like it if that person were forbidden to give evidence in his favour ?
