# text_id = 1998
# text = If we are now living under a state of things in which we contemplate great sums being laid out by a great people for great results — for such results as the defence of our shores from an invading enemy — the mere fact that the sum required for education is numerically great does not make it great when put in juxtaposition with the object which we are seeking to obtain .
