# text_id = 1999
# text = Talk of penal laws — they would be nothing compared to the deprivation of the means of grace , and the blessing of an independent Church they have so long enjoyed , which they consider as their birthright , which they possess by right of a prescription of 300 years , and which was assured to them by as solemn a covenant as one nation could enter into with another .
