# text = It was given at a time when no difference of opinion existed on that subject , and even at the time of the Reformation , when the rulers of the country changed the mode of public worship , they entertained no other idea , but that , either by persuasion or by force , the whole people of Ireland would be brought into connection with the established religion of the country .
