# text_id = 2004
# text = Besides all that , surely no man who sat on that side of the House , and earnestly desired to see the triumph of those measures that would still further promote the well - being and unity of the people , could wish the Liberal party voluntarily to commit suicide , as it unquestionably would , were it now to convert its creed on this point into a kind of guasi-Toryism ?
