# text = He readily joined with other hon . Members in giving credit to the noble Lord ( Viscount Raynham ) for the benevolence of his intentions in bringing forward this Bill ; but he would assure the House that the subject , so far from having been neglected by the Poor Law Board , had been for a long period , and was at this moment , under its consideration .
