# text_id = 2008
# text = He could not help thinking that in consecrating to the office of Bishop a person who might afterwards cease to exercise the functions of Bishop , and even while he performed them only did so at the will of another , they would be creating grave confusion in the minds of the people , and doing much to lower the office of Bishop in the estimation of the country .
