# text_id = 2011
# text = These young gentlemen , instead of being at once draughted to ships , will henceforth be sent for a certain period to cruise on board the Bristol , and I have always thought that it would be of advantage to them to give them an opportunity for practical application of the theoretical I instruction received by them on board the Britannia before undertaking their ordinary duties on board ships of war .
