# text_id = 2014
# text = The proposition of the last - named Gentleman , that in a country the majority of which , and especially of the poor , to which class these children belonged , were Roman Catholics , every deserted child should be entered in the Protestant religion , was so manifestly repugnant to justice that he was not sur- prised that the hon . and learned Member for Belfast threw it overboard .
