# text_id = 2015
# text = The great reason of that evil was not in the schools — for the Commissioners had never said so — but that soon after they left they forgot their reading , writing , and arithmetic , because they left too early , and as there had not been created in their minds a sufficient estimate of the value of those attainments ; and this new scheme would aggravate the evil .
