# text_id = 2016
# text = He observed that a great number of the cricketers belonging to Trinity College , Dublin , obtained honours at the University ; and he believed that the hon . and learned Member for Cambridge University ( Mr. Walpole ) , who was so distinguished for his acquirements , offered while at college to pull a boat , together with his three brothers , against any other for brothers in the kingdom .
