# text_id = 2018
# text = With regard to the noble Earl himself I am informed by the report of what took place , as well as by a gentleman who was present , that the noble Earl , in answer to a deputation which waited upon him on a previous occasion , declared that he only repeated his former impressions when he stated that this tax was bad in principle and bad in practice .
