# text_id = 2019
# text = It is said that the clergy have a vested interest in Church property of the same kind as private property ; but if there be no distinction , how did the noble Earl deal with the Irish Church when he took away so many Bishops and made an arrangement with regard to tithes by which 25 per cent of the tithes were deducted from the property of the Church in Ireland ?
