# text_id = 2027
# text = When they were discussing an Amendment which would have given them what they valued at more than £ 500,000 — namely , the right to trace back these endowments to the time of the Reformation , which their Lordships would have affirmed , they lost the opportunity of taking the opinion of a full Committee , and they did it on the faith of the promise made by the Government .
