# text_id = 2030
# text = In England , when a man enlisted as a recruit , he went with his comrades to the depôt of the regiment singing " Cheer , boys , cheer ! " or some such inspiriting ditty as that ; but when a young French conscript left home to enter upon his military career he took a formal and solemn leave of his family , finishing the ceremony by kissing his grandmother .
