# text = MR. GOSCHEN said , he was sure the Committee would see the necessity of being very clear upon two or three points with respect to this question , and , in the first place , that they would feel the importance of not being guided by the views of any particular towns or alone , of the rating authorities alone , of the owners alone , or of the occupiers alone .
